'''The Rose Garden Witch''' (薔薇園の魔女, ''Baraen no Majo'', '''Rose Garden Witch''') is a [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witch]] enemy that appears in the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = The Rose Garden Witch
|image = E 273.png
|appearance = [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,200¢ - 4,740¢
}}

==Enemy==
This butterfly-like Witch attacks by throwing red couches at a decent distance. Her attack can wipe out most small cats and some medium cats in one hit, so it is still best to keep an ongoing meatshield of smaller cats to protect any larger heavy hitters.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to use any cats that outrange her and keep them protected by using any smaller and cheaper cats. In the long run, defeating The Rose Garden Witch should be not be much of a sweat.

One way to speed up the fight is by using both [[Li'l Madoka (Rare Cat)|Li'l Madoka]] and [[Li'l Homura (Special Cat)|Li'l Homura]] to activate the [[My Very Best Friend (Combo)|My Very Best Friend]] [[Cat Combo|Combo]],  which will greatly amplify the effect of the "Witch Killer" ability against Rose Garden Witch.

